  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 400°F and line a sheet pan with parchment.",
    "Spread the carrots, onion and garlic on the pan. Drizzle with the olive oil and season with the curry powder, smoked paprika, salt and pepper. Toss to coat.",
    "Roast 45-50 min, tossing halfway, until everything is tender and golden at the edges.",
    "Transfer the roasted vegetables to a blender (or a large pot if using an immersion blender). Add the bone broth, tofu, ginger, lemon juice and red pepper flakes.",
    "Blend until completely smooth, working in batches and venting the lid if using a countertop blender. Taste and adjust with more salt, curry powder or lemon. If it cooled while blending, warm it in a pot over medium-low.",
    "Serve topped with Parmesan, basil, a squeeze of lemon and toasted seeds."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Whole pot: 885 cal, 71g protein. Salt makes this soup, so taste and season generously."
  ],
